bds 4,0 "Selected vertical intention"
date 2026-10-14
preamble
    Selected vertical intention, reported by the flight management system.
    Source: ICAO Doc 9871 Table A-2-31.

items

    MCP_ALT_STATUS "MCP Altitude Status"
        definition
            Validity of the MCP/FCU selected altitude value.
        element 1
            table
                0: Not valid
                1: Valid
        remark
            When 0, MCP_ALT should be ignored.

    MCP_ALT "MCP/FCU Selected Altitude"
        definition
            Selected altitude from the Mode Control Panel / Flight Control Unit.
        element 12
            unsigned quantity 16 "ft"
        remark
            MSB = 32768 ft, LSB = 16 ft.

    FMS_ALT_STATUS "FMS Altitude Status"
        definition
            Validity of the FMS selected altitude value.
        element 1
            table
                0: Not valid
                1: Valid

    FMS_ALT "FMS Selected Altitude"
        definition
            Selected altitude from the Flight Management System vertical profile.
        element 12
            unsigned quantity 16 "ft"

    BP_STATUS "Barometric Pressure Status"
        definition
            Validity of the barometric pressure setting value.
        element 1
            table
                0: Not valid
                1: Valid

    BP "Barometric Pressure Setting"
        definition
            Barometric pressure setting (QNH).
        element 12
            unsigned quantity 1/10 "mb"
        remark
            Actual value is raw * 0.1 + 800 mb.

    spare 8

    MODE_STATUS "Status of MCP/FCU Mode Bits"
        definition
            Validity of the MCP/FCU mode bits (VNAV, ALT_HOLD, APP).
        element 1
            table
                0: No mode information provided
                1: Mode information provided

    VNAV "VNAV Mode"
        definition
            VNAV mode active.
        element 1
            table
                0: Not active
                1: Active

    ALT_HOLD "ALT HOLD Mode"
        definition
            Altitude hold mode active.
        element 1
            table
                0: Not active
                1: Active

    APP "APPROACH Mode"
        definition
            Approach mode active.
        element 1
            table
                0: Not active
                1: Active

    spare 2

    TARGET_ALT_STATUS "Status of Target Altitude Source"
        definition
            Validity of the target altitude source bits.
        element 1
            table
                0: No source information provided
                1: Source information provided

    TARGET_ALT_SOURCE "Target Altitude Source"
        definition
            Source of the target (short-term intent) altitude.
        element 2
            table
                0: Unknown
                1: Aircraft altitude
                2: FCU/MCP selected altitude
                3: FMS selected altitude
